\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {28.1}{\ignorespaces The Hasse diagram of $B_2$: all 16 binary Boolean connectives ordered by truth-set inclusion. Bottom: contradiction ($\bot = 0000$). Top: tautology ($\top = 1111$). Highlighted amber path traces $\bot \to \mathrm {NOR} \to \neg A \to \mathrm {NAND} \to \top $. Highlighted purple path traces $\bot \to \mathrm {AND} \to \neg B \to \mathrm {OR} \to \top $.}}{169}{figure.caption.13}%
