\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Spherepop evaluation of $1 + 3 \times 2^2$. Each step collapses an innermost sphere (nested region). The complexity functional $C(E)$ decreases monotonically: $3 \to 2 \to 1 \to 0$.}}{290}{figure.caption.17}%
