\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Hasse diagram of the 16 binary Boolean connectives. Nodes are labeled by their 4-bit output pattern. Highlighted paths trace two chains from $\bot $ (0000) to $\top $ (1111): the amber path through $\mathrm {NOR} \to \neg A \to \mathrm {NAND}$, and the purple path through $\mathrm {AND} \to \neg B \to \mathrm {OR}$.}}{294}{figure.caption.19}%
